=product @PRODUCER@ @BASE@ XZ @PCSIVERSION@ full
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt @PRODUCER@
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt XZ Utils @VERSION@ for OpenVMS
1 'NOTICE
=prompt XZ Utils is free software; liblzma and the tools are under the 0BSD licence; see COPYING.
1 RELEASE_NOTES
=prompt Documentation is in [XZ.DOC]README.VMS under the installation directory.
1 POST_INSTALL
=prompt Post-installation tasks for XZ Utils
    At system startup: to define XZ$ROOT at every boot, add this line to
    SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM:
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:XZ$STARTUP.COM
    For each user: to define the commands, add this line to LOGIN.COM:
    $ @XZ$ROOT:[000000]XZ$SETUP.COM

PRODUCT REMOVE XZ removes the product and deassigns XZ$ROOT.
